abstract: >-
  Sources, evidence ledgers, and reproduction scripts for a comparative narrative
  review of eight grouped mathematical case studies in the OpenAI research
  release. Checks concern bibliography, source statements, elementary examples,
  and document integrity; they do not independently verify the release proofs.
keywords:
